// Methods
bool IsRowExpanded(TGridItem item);
Task ExpandAsync(TGridItem item);
Task CollapseAsync(TGridItem item);
Task CollapseAllAsync();
```

## CSS Classes

| Class | Applied When |
|-------|--------------|
| `row-column-cell` | Always on cell wrapper |
| `row-expanded` | Row is currently expanded |
| `row-dimmed` | Row is dimmed (another expanded) |
| `row-overlay` | Expanded content container |
| `qg-row-grid` | Add to QuickGrid for proper positioning |

## Memory Management

- Uses `ConditionalWeakTable<TGridItem, RowExpandedContext>` for automatic cleanup
- Implements `IDisposable` for proper resource cleanup
- State cleaned up when grid items are garbage collected
